<title>USA: Continental expands Latin American flights.</title>
<headline>Continental expands Latin American flights.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc said on Thursday it had started a daily non-stop flight from the Newark/New York area to Panama City, Panama, and continuing on to Guayaquil, Ecuador.</p>
<p>The airline also started a daily non-stop flight from Houston to Lima, Peru.</p>
<p>&quot;Our new non-stop flights to Latin America are a clear signal of Continental's dedication to the region,&quot; said Ralph Schulz, Continental's vice president for Latin America marketing and sales.</p>
</text>
